{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s02-p01",
      "text": "One day, I picked up my daughter Lingling from school and went to the supermarket for a few things.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p02",
      "text": "I was hoping to be in and out quickly.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p03",
      "text": "I found a short line with just one person in front of me.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p04",
      "text": "It was an old woman, and she was paying for her things with only coins.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p05",
      "text": "After a long day at work, I thought the woman was very terrible.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p06",
      "text": "But then I saw a young salesman.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p07",
      "text": "He helped her count her coins, ever so kindly taking them from her shaking hands.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p08",
      "text": "He repeatedly said and nodded: \"Yes, ma'am.\"",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p09",
      "text": "When she asked if she had enough money to buy a bag, he told her she did.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p10",
      "text": "Then he walked over two lines and got one for her.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p11",
      "text": "This salesman wasn't angry at all.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p12",
      "text": "He was patient and kind.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p13",
      "text": "As I was watching him, I saw Lingling was too.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p14",
      "text": "I realised my daughter was learning an important lesson from a stranger.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p15",
      "text": "When the woman was finished, the salesman began ringing up my things and thanked me for my patience.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p16",
      "text": "I thanked him too.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p17",
      "text": "I found the manager and told him about the salesman's kindness and patience.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p18-01",
      "text": "Then we left the supermarket with a full basket,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p18-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p18-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-p18-02",
      "text": "but also with a heart full of thankfulness for such an important lesson.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p18-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p18-02.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
